# Stremeline Associates — Component Map

Use this as a reference when building each section of the site.
Components marked (A) = Aceternity UI, (M) = Magic UI, (S) = shadcn/ui.

## Hero Section

| Element | Component | Source |
|---------|-----------|--------|
| Background | Aurora Background or Background Beams | (A) ui.aceternity.com/components/background-beams |
| Headline reveal | Text Generate Effect | (A) ui.aceternity.com/components/text-generate-effect |
| Subheadline | Typewriter Effect — cycle through "leads", "workflows", "operations" | (A) ui.aceternity.com/components/typewriter-effect |
| CTA buttons | Button with shimmer/glow | (S) + custom |
| 3D ambient | Particle field or globe via React Three Fiber | @react-three/fiber + drei |

Tagline: "AI agents that give time back to your business."

## What We Do (Services)

| Element | Component |
|---------|-----------|
| Section layout | Bento Grid | (M) magicui.design/docs/components/bento-grid |
| Card hover | 3D Card Effect | (A) ui.aceternity.com/components/3d-card-effect |
| Icons | Lucide React icons |
| Scroll reveal | GSAP ScrollTrigger fade-up on each card |

Services: Lead capture, Workflow automation, CRM data hygiene, Sales/ops handoffs, Alerts/reporting.

## How It Works (Process)

| Element | Component |
|---------|-----------|
| Section header | Lamp Effect | (A) ui.aceternity.com/components/lamp-effect |
| Step flow | Animated Beam diagram | (M) magicui.design/docs/components/animated-beam |
| Step pins | GSAP ScrollTrigger pin each step as user scrolls |
| Step icons | Orbiting Circles | (M) magicui.design/docs/components/orbiting-circles |

Steps: 1. Audit  2. Design  3. Build & Deploy  4. Optimize

